parametrization -- compute a rational parametrization
*****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        H=parametrization(PJ,adjList)
  * Inputs:
      * PJ, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, coordinate ring of the last
        adjoint surface
      * adjList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, list of adjoint matrices
  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, parametrization of the
        rational surface X

Description
===========

